Z||000003||Greg Piet||02-14-2000||10:48 AM||||Checker Auto is a chain store.  It is also called "checker Schucks Kragen" or one of the three.  Their website is <A HREF="http://www.cskauto.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cskauto.com</A> <BR>with an online parts catalog, but i got these prices at one of the stores where the clerks changed the prices from a higher price to 5% below summit.  It was something about Checker claiming to beat anyones prices by 5%.  They say its not for mail orders, but they said summit is the only mail order thay will beat.||||reg||1
Z||000004||GT Bastard||02-14-2000||03:29 PM||||We just got a few Checker stores here recently, and they have a nice selection.  Most of it's cleaning supplies though, hehe. Do they stock the MSD coil for the 2.8??||||reg||1
Z||000005||Greg Piet||02-14-2000||09:24 PM||||most stores do not carry it(although they can get it within a week).  There are some checkers that are "speed shops".  These normally sell NOS.  So if one store sells NOS, it might have an MSD GM Blaster coil.<BR>||||reg||1
